"teclado."

msgid ""
"AutoKey will take the full ownership of the directory you are about to "
"select or create. It is advisable to only choose empty directories or "
"directories that contain data created by AutoKey previously.\n"
"\n"
"If you delete or move the directory from within AutoKey (for example by "
"using drag and drop), all files unknown to AutoKey will be deleted."
msgstr ""
"AutoKey se hará cargo por completo del directorio que va a seleccionar o "
"crear. Es aconsejable elegir solo directorios vacíos o directorios que "
"contengan datos creados anteriormente por AutoKey.\n"
"\n"
"Si elimina o mueve el directorio desde AutoKey (por ejemplo, arrastrándolo y "
"soltándolo), se eliminarán todos los archivos que AutoKey no reconozca."

