msgid ""
"Enable undoing Phrase expansions using the backspace key\n"
"\n"
"Undo only works if the Phrase does not contain any special keys.\n"
"AutoKey will refuse to perform an undo of a Phrase containing any such "
"keys,\n"
"regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""
"Permite deshacer las expansiones de frases con la tecla de retroceso\n"
"\n"
"Deshacer solo funciona si la frase no contiene teclas especiales.\n"
"AutoKey se negará a deshacer una frase que contenga alguna de esas teclas,\n"
"independientemente de este ajuste."

